{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026XZZw5TXDHl1794451940.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>鄧凱文（Eris）與「高成彬」劉倬昕10日於社交平台分享了一段創意十足的短片，二人大玩「交換穿搭」挑戰，反差感十足的造型與逗趣互動，瞬間吸引大批網民關注與熱烈討論。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"ce5aac4b-85a6-4352-8dc0-bef01d104d4a.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Jk5xlKaTEW1794451939.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>從短片可見，兩人起初以各自的原本造型亮相：鄧凱文身穿一襲白色斜肩連身短裙，搭配粉色尖頭高跟鞋，盡顯優雅氣質；而劉倬昕則穿上一身黑色西裝套裝，內搭香檳色恤衫與領帶，腳踏黑色厚底皮鞋，斯文帥氣。</p><p>隨後畫面一轉，兩人透過轉場特效瞬間「互換穿搭」！穿上白色女裝短裙的劉倬昕雖然顯得相當侷促，不過依然大方晒出健碩手臂，並刻意擺出驚訝、委屈等誇張表情，十分搞笑。至於換上寬鬆黑色西裝的鄧凱文則帥氣登場，雙手插袋對著鏡頭擺出自信甫士，型格十足。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"c25a193f-8df2-4b96-933e-6b07f4998bed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026X3DtZfKxpl1794451939.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5146e446-344f-452f-8a2b-08cf99ce7c70.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026awW6XGbK4Y1794451939.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>短片曝光後迅速引起網民熱議，不少人留言大讚二人極具喜感，亦指劉倬昕的裙裝造型相當有驚喜；而劉倬昕本人也搞笑留言表示：「我把時間永久性定格在這1秒！」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.072002+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":373,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T02:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T18:17:36.362295+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:37:16.345911+00:00","content_hash":"ffb99d1b9f77993ac2a417d19d2eec443b72a27ebfa1bc589e449538f09f8ca8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.072002+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}